<title>USA: Wheaton Corp to close Easton, Md., plastics plant.</title>
<headline>Wheaton Corp to close Easton, Md., plastics plant.</headline>
<dateline>EASTON, Md. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheaton Corp said it would close its eastern shore plant in Easton, Md., and lay off more than 100 employees as a result.</p>
<p>The factory, in the Airpark Industrial Park, manufactures plastic packaging used in the pharmaceutical industry.</p>
<p>The company told employees it will close the plant in the near future but gave no exact date. Company officials say the decision is based on industry economics.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650))</p>
